Token treated as expired when `now >= expiry`. Should allow `now == expiry` (token valid at expiry moment).

**Fix:** Replace comparison operator.
```javascript
// Buggy
if (now >= expiry) reject();

// Correct
if (now > expiry) reject();
```

Or flip the check:
```javascript
